  "text_md": "## TRHININGZONE\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## WEEK 01\n\n## Rest day\n\nAMSwim2,5OOm Techniquesession\n\nWU3x300as(IOOmFC, IOOmKICK, IOOmPULL) MAIN8xSOmas (25mFISTS, 25mFC) 3x(150m WD3OOmeasyFCorBACK\n\nPMBike SOmins WUIOminsin Z2MAINIO,9,\n\nRun 45mins WUIOminsas (SminsinZ2,Smins inZ3) MAIN BxIminflat-out fast (+2minsjogRI) WDIOminsinZ2\n\nFC, IOOmKICK, 300mPULL,IOOmKICK WD 2OOmeasy FCIBACK PMBike 5Omins WUIOminsas (SminsinZ2, SminsinZ3) MAIN6x3minshardinZ4 (+3minRI\n\ninZI)WDSminsin Z2\n\nRun6Omins WU 25minsinZ2 MAIN ISminsinZ3WD 2OminsinZ2\n\nBike 2hourenduranceridein Z2\n\nBike 2hourenduranceridein Z2\n\n## WEEK 02\n\n## Rest day\n\nAMSwim 2,5OOm Muscular endurancesession +2OsecsRI, 2OOmPULLinZI, IOOmFCinZ3 WDSOOmeasy FCorBACK\n\nPMBike5Omins WUIOminsinZ2\n\nMAIN3,4,5,6,5,4,3minsallinZ3 (+IminRI) WD4minsin Z2\n\nRun 4Omins WU I2minsas (Sminsin Z2, Smins inZ3, 2minsin Z2) MAIN Sx2minsflat-outfast (+2minsjogrecoveries) WDIOminsin Z2\n\nAMSwim2,6OOmStrengthsession WU 2O0m ANKLESin Z2 +3OsecsRIWD4OOmFCIBACKI BREASTPMBike 4Smins WU IOminsas (Smins inZ2, SminsinZ3) MAIN3Ominsas (alternating 2minsinZ4, 2minsinZ2)WDSminsinZ2\n\nRun6Omins WU 25minsinZ2\n\nMAIN ISminsinZ3WD 2Ominsin Z2\n\nBike 2hr 3Omins enduranceridein Z2\n\nBike 2hr 3OminsendurancerideinZ2\n\n5\n\nẵ\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## TRAINING ZONES\n\nUSING THESE Training Zones will helpyou train at theright intensity for each session. This helps develop specific aspects ofyour fitness, as well as making sureyou don'toverdoit.\n\nYoucan either estimate your intensity using the Training Zone descriptions, or useaheart-rate monitor for a more precise measure: If you useaheart-rate monitor; use the percentages provided andsubtract them from your maximum heart rate to calculateyour zones. Tools like cycle power meters and GPS watches willalso help track your training progress, but they're not essentialfor these plans.\n\nThesetraining zones are onlya sodon'tworry about being overly precise with heart rates because they'll fluctuate anyway. Its goodto be mindfulofyour intensity but it's even more important that you outthere andenjoyyour training. guide, get\n\n## ZONE1 [Zl] Recovery\n\n60t0 65% ofyour maximum. Easy pace, feels nice and light.\n\n65t0 75% ofyour maximum: Fairly easy pace; Easy enough so that you could breathejust through your nose ifyou wanted to\n\n## ZONE3 [Z3] Tempo\n\n75%to 80% ofyour maximum. A fairly hard but sustainable pace:\n\n## ZONE 4 [Z4] Race tempo\n\n80t0 90% of your maximum. A hard pace that requires real focus tosustain\n\nKEYWU Warmup, WD Warmdown, MAIN Mainset, FC Frontcrawl, KICK Kick withafloatheldoutinfrontofyou; BUILD Graduallyincreasetheintensityofeach repwithinaset; PULL Frontcrawlwitha lfloatbetweenthighs, RI Restinterval, BACK Backstroke; BREAST Breaststroke; 1-ARM Front crawlusing onearmonly N/s Negativesplit-swimthe 2ndhalffasterthanthefirst, FDRAGDragyour fingers along thesurfaceduringtheFCarmrecovery; FISTS Swim FCwithclenched fists, DOG Doggy paddle; SCULL Kick witharms heldoutin front, scullingyour handssidetoside, BAND Front crawlwitharubber bandorinner-tubetiedaround ankles, ANKLES Frontcrawlwith pullfloat betweenankles pull\n\n## STAY IN THE TRAINING ZONE WITH TRIATHLON PLUS\n\n## WEEK 03\n\n## Rest day\n\nAMSwim 2,90Om Techniquesession (3OOmPULLinZ3 +3OsecsRI, IOOmFCinZ2 FCinZ4 +2OsecsRI) WD 4OOmeasy FCorBACK PMBike 5Omins WUIOminsin Z2MAINIO,9, 8minsallin Z3(+9OsecsRI) WD IOminsinZ2\n\nRun 4Omins WUISminsas (IOminsin Z2,Smins inZ3)MAIN 4x3mins flat-out fast(+2minsjog recoveries) WD8minsinZ2\n\nAMSwim2, 5OOmStrengthsession WU2x250mFC, IOOmKICK, 2OOmPULL MAIN8x(25mSCULL 25mFC)+IOsecsRI, IOOm PULLinZ4 +IOsecsRI, 2OOm FCinZ3 +IOsecsRI, +2OsecsRI, IOOmFCinZ4WD4OOmFCinZI PMBike 45mins WUIOminsas (SminsinZ2 SminsinZ3) MAIN3Ominsas (alternating 2mins inZ4,2minsinZ2) WD SminsinZ2\n\nRun6Omins WU 25minsinZ2 MAIN ISminsinZ3WD 2OminsinZ2\n\nBike3hourenduranceridein Z2\n\nBike 2hourenduranceridein Z2\n\n## WEEK 04\n\n## Rest day\n\nAMSwim2 OOOm Techniquesession WU3OOmFC; 2OOmKICK, IOOmPULL +2Osecs WD2OOmeasy FCorBACK PMBike 4Smins WUISminsas IOminsinZ2, alternating (3Osecsmax, 3Osecsrecovery spin)\n\n3minsinZ3,2minsin Z2MAIN 2Ominsas WDIOminsinZ2\n\nSmins\n\nFC, IOOmKICK, 2OOmPULL, IOOmFC (2OOmPULL; IOOm KICKinZ3) +3OsecsRI WD4OOmBACKIBREAST PMBike 45mins WUISminsas IOminsinZ2, 3minsinZ3, 2minsinZ2MAIN 2Ominsas alternating (3Osecsmax, 3Osecsrecovery spin)\n\nWDIOminsinZ2\n\nRun 4Omins WU ISminsinZ2 MAIN ISminsinZ3WDIOminsinZ2\n\nBike 2hourenduranceridein Z2\n\nBike 2hourenduranceridein Z2\n\n<!-- image -->\n\ntriradarcom\n\n5\n\nẵ\n\nẵ\n\n<!-- image -->",
